@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# Expense feature checks
+
+Run these Foundation/Observation checks from the repository root without changing the Xcode project:
+
+```sh
+xcrun swiftc -parse-as-library -swift-version 5 -default-isolation MainActor \
+  Sprout/Models/Expense.swift Sprout/Models/ExpenseFormatting.swift \
+  Sprout/Services/ExpenseAPI.swift Sprout/Services/ExpenseStore.swift \
+  Tests/ExpenseFeatureChecks.swift -o /tmp/sprout-expense-checks
+/tmp/sprout-expense-checks
+```
+
+The checks cover US/German/French decimal input and currency output, French grouping spaces, invalid full-string input, exact decimal sums, localized date labels, local-noon date parsing, DST dates, month/year boundaries, API success/failure, and duplicate submission prevention.
+
+The required app build remains:
+
+```sh
+xcodebuild -scheme Sprout -destination 'generic/platform=iOS Simulator' build
+```
